    description: "WI-mafik Level 1b child. cpp.py emits calls edges whose dst contains no header/module info: `#include <cstdio>` + `std::printf(...)` emits `cpp:external:0-0:printf:unresolved` instead of a dst connecting to `cstdio`. Same shape for `using namespace std;` + bare call and `using std::name;` + bare call. Repro in polyglot fixture::cpp. The analyzer doesn't associate `#include` directives with subsequent calls. Fix lives in packages/hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/src/hypergumbo_lang_mainstream/cpp.py — include-to-name resolution at the call site. Acceptance: remove xfail_reason for cpp in the polyglot fixture without other test changes."  # 4145
